# {{place|de|country|r/Western Asia,Southeast Europe|t=Turkey}}

====Usage notes====
* Unlike most German names of countries (which are usually neuter), {{lang|de|''Türkei''}} is feminine and takes the definite article {{m|de|die}}.
* {{ux|de|'''Die Türkei''' befindet sich sowohl in Asien als auch in Europa.|Turkey is located in both Asia and Europe.}}
* {{ux|de|Viele Bewohner Deutschlands stammen aus '''der Türkei'''.|Lots of residents of Germany are from Turkey.}}
* Very occasionally, ''Türkei'' occurs without a definite article; in such cases a genitive ''Türkeis'' may occur. In such usages, the gender is unclear.

